From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:55:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] dt-bindings: clock: document the Hi3716CV200 CRG in YAML

The Hi3716CV200 core CRG needs its compatible in the schema and its
clock ids published. Add the compatible to hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml; the
id header comes with the driver block.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - hisilicon,hi3516cv300-crg
+              - hisilicon,hi3716cv200-crg
               - hisilicon,hi3798cv200-crg
               - hisilicon,hi3798mv100-crg
           - const: syscon
